<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Anette Saviauk, veebiprogrammeerimine</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/gallery.css">
    <script src="/script/gallery.js" defer></script>
</head>

<body>
    <img src="/images/vp_banner_2025_AA.jpg" alt="Kursuse bänner">
    <h1>Anette Saviauk, veebiprogrammeerimine</h1>
    <p>See leht on loodud <a href="https://www.tlu.ee">Tallinna Ülikoolis</a> veebiprogrammeerimise kursusel ja ei oma
        mõistlikku sisu.</p>
    <p>Veebiprogrammeerimine on tore.</p>
    <hr>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Avalehele</a></li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Fotogalerii</h2>
    <dialog id="modal" class="modalarea">
        <span id="modalClose" class="modalclose">&times;</span>
        <div class="modalhorizontal">
            <div class="modalvertical">
                <p id="modalCaption"></p>
                <img id="modalImage" src="/images/empty.png" alt="Galeriipilt">
            </div>
        </div>
    </dialog>
    <p><%- galleryLinks %></p>
    <div id="gallery" class="gallery">
        <% galleryData.forEach(function(image){ %>
            <img src="<%=imagehref%><%=image.src%>" alt="<%=image.alt%>" class="thumbs" data-filename="<%=image.src%>">
            <% }); %>
    </div>
</body>

</html>